<p class=3DMsoNormal>This is probably the biggest danger for you.</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>You might start thinking:</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>&quot;I'll build an LMS + AI tutor + video conferencin=
g +
mobile app + chatbot + payment system + facial recognition + plagiarism
detector...&quot;</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>Don't. <span style=3D'font-family:"Segoe UI Emoji",san=
s-serif;
mso-bidi-font-family:"Segoe UI Emoji"'>&#128516;</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>You'll spend four months building authentication.</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>Instead use:</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b>MVP<o:p></o:p></b></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b>Student</b><br>
&#8594; Register<br>
&#8594; Login<br>
&#8594; Choose course<br>
&#8594; Study lesson<br>
&#8594; Take quiz<br>
&#8594; Get score<br>
&#8594; See weak areas<br>
&#8594; Receive recommendation</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>That's enough.</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>Then add:</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b>Teacher</b><br>
&#8594; Create course<br>
&#8594; Create lesson<br>
&#8594; Create quiz<br>
&#8594; View student performance</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>Then, if you still have time:</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b>AI</b><br>
&#8594; Ask AI<br>
&#8594; Generate questions<br>
&#8594; Generate study plan</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>That's a very respectable project.</p>

