<p class=3DMsoNormal>I would frame it as:</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b>A mobile-based secure classroom quiz and assessment
platform for undergraduate education.</b></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>The key problem isn't simply &quot;online quizzes are
difficult.&quot;</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>It's:</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b>How can a teacher conduct a quick, controlled digit=
al
assessment using students' existing smartphones while minimizing opportunit=
ies
for students to access other apps or resources?</b></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>That's a much better project problem.</p>

