<p class=3DMsoNormal>Don't write in your proposal:</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>&quot;The application completely prevents students from
cheating.&quot;</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>Instead:</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b>&quot;The application aims to reduce opportunities =
for digital
cheating during supervised classroom assessments through application lockdo=
wn,
question randomization, time restrictions, and teacher monitoring.&quot;</b=
></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>That is technically and academically much stronger.</p>

