trying to invent the lockdown mechanism yourself.</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>There is one important catch, though:</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b>The free part is the software. The difficult part is
Android device provisioning and the limitations of students' personal phone=
s.</b></p>

