<p class=3DMsoNormal><b>Don't use AI for <span class=3DGramE>the lockdown</=
span><o:p></o:p></b></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>You <b>could</b> use AI to help you write/debug the co=
de,
but AI itself shouldn't be responsible for locking the phone.</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>For example, don't try to create:</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>&quot;AI detects whether the student is cheating.&quot=
;</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>That's much harder, unreliable, and unnecessary.</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>Instead:</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b>Android OS &#8594; lockdown</b></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b>Your backend &#8594; quiz/session</b></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b>Your application &#8594; detects/report violations<=
/b></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b>Teacher &#8594; physical supervision</b></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>That's <span class=3DGramE>a much</span> better archit=
ecture.</p>

