<p class=3DMsoNormal>This is something you need to understand before commit=
ting
to the feature.</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b>Device Owner &#8800; normal app<o:p></o:p></b></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>For the strongest Android lockdown, the device general=
ly
needs to be provisioned as a <b>managed/dedicated device</b>.</p>

